::: info
(Programming paradigm, Language feature/design) In languages with [closure](/journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/closure)s or prototypes, a function that returns objects of similar shapes.
:::

::: info
(Language feature/design) [Rocq] A **value builder** in Rocq that introduces inhabitants of an [inductive type](/journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/inductive-type) (like `O` and `S` for `nat`, or `Some` and `None` for `option`), enabling [pattern matching](/journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/pattern-matching) and [structural recursion](/journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/structural-recursion).
:::
